or just enjoying the thrill of hitting balls in a virtual tennis arena. Every hit earns you points, and every second counts\u2014can you beat your high score before the timer runs out?\n\nWhether you're looking for a quick session or an intense rally challenge, Tennis VR delivers fast-paced fun with intuitive mechanics and satisfying racket physics. It\u2019s tennis practice made accessible, engaging, and sweat-worthy in VR!\n\nKey Features:\n\nIntuitive racket controls with realistic hit feedback\n\nScore-based gameplay with a timed challenge\n\nSimple, clean visuals focused on performance and f", "short_description": "Train your swing in this fun and fast-paced tennis practice game!\nHit incoming balls with your racket to earn points. Test your reflexes, improve your timing, and aim for the highest score before time runs out. \n\n"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://lucido.life/policy/racketrush/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Lucido Inc", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://lucido.life/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2776542286000603"}, {"id": "331529188132278"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "24235136102760295"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499318455_9982516598453636_197911925187897197_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=110&_nc_map=urlgen_bucke